 ## Unreleased
 
+- Fixed: tax on each charge is rounded half up to the cent; it was rounded down.
 - Stays of up to 45 nights are accepted by default (`max_stay_nights`).
 - The audit journal writes amounts as `0.00` instead of whole cents.
 - `hk-sheets` splits the day's housekeeping between attendants, floor by floor.
